WEBVTT

00:00:00.356 --> 00:00:05.556
On the phone, the floating bar runs along the bottom of the home list, with the bell for Needs you.

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:12.625
Opening Needs you now gives a full page, and the bar steps aside. The page has its own close button.

00:00:13.752 --> 00:00:15.832
Closing the page brings the bar back.
